.TH BATTLELINES 1
.SH NAME
battlelines \- swarm combat game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/battlelines
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I BattleLines
is a swarm combat game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Two swarms of troopers fight across the window. Hold button 1 or 2 near the pointer to attract or repel your side. Corner bars show remaining strength.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB hold
Apply force field at pointer (attract/repel per wheel and RMB)
.TP
.B RMB hold
Invert attractive/repulsive sense of force
.TP
.B mouse wheel buttons 4/8 (if wm sends)
Decrease/increase force radius wheel_z
.TP
.B , / -
Decrease force radius
.TP
.B . / + / =
Increase force radius
.TP
.B 1
Toggle time-lapse (fast motion)
.TP
.B 2
Toggle tap-mode (local push within radius)
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/battlelines.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
